---
description: Project conventions — copy to .mdc, rename, and scope with globs
globs: src/**,tests/**,openapi.yaml
alwaysApply: false
---

# Project conventions

- Stack and module system (language, framework, package manager)
- Persistence / data rules agents must not violate
- Error or response envelope the API/UI must keep
- Docs that must update in the same change as behaviour
- Test runner and how tests should import the app (no live listeners, etc.)
- Prefer smallest safe diffs; no drive-by refactors
